Subject: [PATCH 2/2] README: Jupyter extras last one server session

Only ~/work is kept across JupyterHub server restarts, so
lakehouse-install-requirements has to be rerun after every server start.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
